## Upstream Projects & Open-Source Attributions

Mochy Music stands on the shoulders of these open-source projects and services:

- **Mochy Music** by [realidkroo](https://github.com/realidkroo) — https://github.com/realidkroo/Mochy-Music (Original Android app, design language, player presets, Audio Lab, Monochrome & JioSaavn modules, and Mochy mark)
- **ViviMusic** by [vivizzz007Z](https://github.com/vivizzz007/vivi-music) — Base app from which Mochy Music was forked
- **Metrolist** by [Mostafa Alagamy](https://github.com/mostafaalagamy/Metrolist) — Base framework
- **SimpMusic** by [maxrave-dev](https://github.com/maxrave-dev/SimpMusic) — Lyrics API provider
- **ArchiveTune** by [Rukamori](https://github.com/rukamori/ArchiveTune) — Design & architectural inspiration
- **RiMusic / InnerTube** by [fast4x](https://github.com/fast4x/RiMusic) — YouTube Music InnerTube API service wrapper
- **InnertubeX** by [nyxiereal](https://github.com/metrolistGroup/innertubex) — YouTube stream extraction library
- **LRCLib** by [tranxuanthang](https://github.com/tranxuanthang/lrclib) (https://lrclib.net/) — Synchronized LRC lyrics provider
- **Monochrome Music** by [monochrome-music](https://github.com/monochrome-music/monochrome) (https://monochrome.st) — Lossless FLAC stream ecosystem
- **AutoEq** (https://autoeq.app) — Headphone equalizer preset database
- **lrc.red** (https://lrc.red) — Word-timed lyrics
- **LyricsPlus / YouLyPlus** by [Ibra Al Tabian](https://github.com/ibratabian17/LyricsPlus) — Word/syllable-timed lyrics API
- **Better Lyrics API** by [Boidushya](https://github.com/better-lyrics/api) & **Unison Lyrics** (https://github.com/better-lyrics/unison) — TTML & syllable lyrics
